{"id":"f6ccc7c06d940d91","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-power-object-membership.md","title":"Definition — 幂对象的隶属子对象","display":"Definition — 幂对象的隶属子对象","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-power-object-membership","aliases":["14-df-power-object-membership"],"display":"Definition — 幂对象的隶属子对象","depends_on":["[[14-df-power-objects-exponentials-global-elements]]","[[14-df-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-df-subobjects]]","[[14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-power-object-membership"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-power-object-membership</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 幂对象的隶属子对象"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7df95b777d9b2ddd\" href=\"?note=7df95b777d9b2ddd\" title=\"14-df-power-objects-exponentials-global-elements\">14-df-power-objects-exponentials-global-elements</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" href=\"?note=a0c7f4bf5e51d4b5\" title=\"14-df-subobject-classifier\">14-df-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3923e299ec2ec5a\" href=\"?note=d3923e299ec2ec5a\" title=\"14-df-subobjects\">14-df-subobjects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" href=\"?note=4e6c05c92e3b9bf9\" title=\"14-df-elementary-topos\">14-df-elementary-topos</a> 的初等拓扑斯，指定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>、分类子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Omega,\\top)\">\\((\\Omega,\\top)\\)</span> 与有限极限。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P(A)=\\Omega^A\">\\(P(A)=\\Omega^A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}:P(A)\\times A\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}:P(A)\\times A\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 为求值态射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_A:A\\hookrightarrow A\\times A\">\\(\\Delta_A:A\\hookrightarrow A\\times A\\)</span> 为对角态射。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>；子对象逆像采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b51ff4f43221971d\" href=\"?note=b51ff4f43221971d\" title=\"14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image\">14-df-subobject-order-inverse-image</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_A:=\\operatorname{ev}^{-1}([\\top])\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(P(A)\\times A),\\qquad\\operatorname{Eq}_A:=[\\Delta_A]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A\\times A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon_A:=\\operatorname{ev}^{-1}([\\top])\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(P(A)\\times A),\\qquad\\operatorname{Eq}_A:=[\\Delta_A]\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathcal E}(A\\times A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IV.1、VI.5：隶属关系由指数求值的真纤维内建，等号由对角子对象内建；二者均无需外部原子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-power-objects-exponentials-global-elements","status":"resolved",